{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"24":"Wages (Kitab Al-Ijarah)"},"section_detail":{"24":{"hadithnumber_first":3416,"hadithnumber_last":3570,"arabicnumber_first":3416,"arabicnumber_last":3570,"name_native":"كتاب الإجارة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3487,"arabicnumber":3487,"text":"حدثنا محمد بن بشار، حدثنا ابو عاصم، عن عبد الحميد بن جعفر، عن يزيد بن ابي حبيب، قال كتب الى عطاء عن جابر، نحوه لم يقل \" هو حرام","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (2236) Sahih Muslim (1581)"}],"reference":{"book":24,"hadith":72}}]}